---
description: Conventions for packages/shared in the monorepo
globs: packages/shared/**/*
alwaysApply: false
---

# `packages/shared`

- Put cross-app **types**, constants, and validation schemas here.
- Do not import React, Fastify, TypeORM, or DOM APIs into shared.
- Prefer framework-agnostic Zod (or similar) schemas both apps can reuse.
- Keep the package small; promote code here only when both apps need it.
